  (text "LED data: the RP2350's 3.3 V LED_DATA is re-driven at 5 V by U40 (notebook p. 23), then runs through the 30 keys in order:\nkey n receives LED_CHn on its DIN and returns LED_CHn+1 from its DOUT. TP1 is the end of the chain."
