  (text "Key-base link per key (J1nn = key n): 1 +5V, 2 GND, 3 LED DIN, 4 LED DOUT, 5 DET (pogo pins; the cap shorts DET to GND).\nR1nn pulls DET up to +3.3VA, so DET reads high with the cap off and low with it on. JST SH footprint is a placeholder\nuntil the key-base wiring (flex or wires) is chosen."
    (at 25.4 254 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "50570c7d-6b48-5d05-9ad0-19b6c76e9b05")))
